{"id":"1c2bc047ee96bbf7be9cdd53a99f7ed0fc667e1d","url":"https://www.leiphone.com/category/ai/mx99nwAcQHgHCbka.html","title":"拆解 Mistral AI 新项目Shieldstral，看 3B 小模型如何重构 AI 安全审核范式","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":null,"excerpt":"一款 3B 级分类器，可通过统一接口审核文本、图片以及图文混合内容。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n                                                <!-- 123 -->\n                        \n                        \n                                                \n                        <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- xhBPeYDbNuuRZkwy -->\n                                                <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- 正文内容 -->\n                        <section data-mpa-action-id=\"mmiwq6ij1i3r\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img alt=\"拆解 Mistral AI 新项目Shieldstral，看 3B 小模型如何重构 AI 安全审核范式\" data-src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260817/6a82cdea5d2b6.jpg\" data-ratio=\"0.55\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1000\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/XqAicMdcoiafO7OfohzqRWic2HCzX5wIic8oVwVTS8qKDVUzVKa4ZZ51k6Sakx8CFEN9rtJoazfnQCHib2TWNrooT2keQPtgIM8cO9CRicXQlCgibU/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" data-cropselx2=\"546\" data-cropsely2=\"307\" data-imgfileid=\"100257523\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260817/6a82cdea5d2b6.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\"></section><section data-pm-slice=\"5 10 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix4tgk1t7p\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-data-temp-type=\"image\" mpa-data-temp-power-by=\"yiban.io\" data-mpa-template=\"t\" data-mid=\"\"><section><section><span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix6wyl1l05\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">一款 3B 级分类器，可通过统一接口审核文本、图片以及图文混合内容。</span></span></span></span></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mqgbkegzw9n\"></span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mpmlbwxl8oz\"></span><span data-lark-record-data=\"{&quot;rootId&quot;:&quot;FdZedu